	(text "BLUETOOTH CAR-KIT BOARD - DRAFT SCHEMATIC (generated, unreviewed). Notes: electronics/bluetooth/README.md.\nOne USB cable from the H5 -> USB2514Bi hub -> MCP2221A (AT commands to the Feasycom FSC-BT1026C), PCM2900C USB\ncodec (records the module line out: phone music and calls go into the H5), and the module own USB."
